sequenceDiagram
    actor Usuario
    participant API
    participant Orchestrator
    participant RouterStateMachine
    participant KB
    participant LLM
    participant SQLDB
    Usuario->>API: POST /api/chat · /webhooks/twilio
    API->>Orchestrator: handle_turn
    Orchestrator->>KB: compilar contexto (steps, gates, atoms, framing)
    Orchestrator->>RouterStateMachine: compile_context + draft_response (estados router)
    RouterStateMachine->>LLM: draft con framing + atoms groundeados
    LLM-->>RouterStateMachine: respuesta + flow_node + tool_call
    RouterStateMachine->>SQLDB: persistir turn, flow_node, session_state
    Orchestrator-->>API: turno enriquecido (system_turn, trace)
    API-->>Usuario: respuesta (JSON / TwiML)